 "result": "\n\nScenario written to `scenario.json`.\n\n**Request:** \"Add the note Scope locked to the description of the Web team's current cycle, the one that ends on September 30.\" — one record: Web's active cycle 41 (Sep 16 → Sep 30), updated via `cycleUpdate` on `description`.\n\n**Decoys:**\n- `c-web-42` — fact `A:Cycle.endsAt`, family **F1**: Web's next cycle, active, that *starts* Sep 30 (ends Oct 1) — the requested date is its startsAt, not its endsAt; mutation swaps the endsAt day-range for a startsAt range and selects exactly it.\n- `c-pay-41` — fact `R:Cycle.teamId`, family **F8**: Payments' Cycle 41 with identical start/end dates, also active — same-numbered cycle of the other team; mutation swaps the team edge to Payments and selects exactly it.\n\nThird condition (\"current cycle\" → `D:current_cycle`) is decoy-free and flag-based (`isActive`), so it verifies without relying on the replica clock; background cycles (Web #40, Payments #40) fail ≥2 conditions each.",
